direction: right
title: HotSpot Tiered Compilation Architecture

T0: Tier 0: Interpreter (Fast startup, gathering counters)
T1: Tier 1-3: C1 Client Compiler (Fast native code + profiling)
T4: Tier 4: C2 Server Compiler (Escape Analysis & Inlining)
Cache: Code Cache (Direct x86-64 Native Machine Code)

T0 -> T1: Invocations > threshold { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
T1 -> T4: Hot path peak threshold { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
T4 -> Cache: Emits optimized assembly { style.stroke: "#10B981" }
Cache -> T0: Deoptimization trap { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
